<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.8"/>
    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Numbness, tingling and loss of position sense in the fingers of both hands for three weeks, worse on the left, with clumsiness that makes her lose her place on the fingerboard, an electric feeling down the spine on bending the neck (Lhermitte&apos;s sign), and fatigue; a similar month of tingling in the fingers 18 months ago settled on its own. A lesion of the cervical spinal cord must be found: MRI of the brain and spine with contrast booked this week: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.10" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Urgent work-up of a sensory syndrome of both hands with Lhermitte&apos;s sign: MRI of the brain and cervical and thoracic spine with gadolinium within a week; blood count, chemistry, vitamin B12 and TSH; lumbar puncture for oligoclonal bands if the MRI is suggestive; return at once for weakness, unsteadiness, loss of bladder control or loss of vision. Guideline: Multiple sclerosis in adults: management (NICE guideline NG220) (2022); Thompson AJ, et al. Diagnosis of multiple sclerosis: 2017 revisions of the McDonald criteria. Lancet Neurol 2018;17(2):162-173 (PMID 29275977) (2017); Wattjes MP, et al. 2021 MAGNIMS-CMSC-NAIMS consensus recommendations on the use of MRI in patients with multiple sclerosis. Lancet Neurol 2021;20(8):653-670 (PMID 34139157) (2021) [S]</item><item>Fatigue, mood and work: screening for depression and sleep problems at each visit, plain explanations with written information, and a plan built around her practice, performing and teaching; she decides who is told and who receives each note. Guideline: Multiple sclerosis in adults: management (NICE guideline NG220) (2022); Depression and Suicide Risk in Adults: Screening (2023) [S]</item><item ID="referral-order">Referral to neurology (multiple sclerosis), Rafael Lindgren-Achebe, MD, ordered 1973-03-09 [S]</item></list></text>

